    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/9f236a5added1e912c72a63d00fea983.avif?t=1749218559\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Departure of Darkness is a classic late-90's style survival-horror game set in a fictional airport in the year 2005.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Emma Reed, arriving at the terminal to pick up her younger brother Jake. With the airport in lockdown and no help coming, Emma must navigate the chaos, find Jake, and lead a growing group of survivors to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet as enemies react to sound. Every step, shot, or scream could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/365909ea12138d21d68cc23d2165ecbc.avif?t=1749218559\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked cameras, zombies and everything you remember from the 90's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late 90's and early 2000s nostalgic visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth-based survival and exploration. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasite\u2019s can hear you, don\u2019t make a sound</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/369921efc454460b0633580a53281c03.avif?t=1749218559\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of enemies and locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead survivors to safety</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/9f236a5added1e912c72a63d00fea983.avif?t=1749218559\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Departure of Darkness is a classic late-90's style survival-horror game set in a fictional airport in the year 2005.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Emma Reed, arriving at the terminal to pick up her younger brother Jake. With the airport in lockdown and no help coming, Emma must navigate the chaos, find Jake, and lead a growing group of survivors to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay quiet as enemies react to sound. Every step, shot, or scream could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/365909ea12138d21d68cc23d2165ecbc.avif?t=1749218559\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked cameras, zombies and everything you remember from the 90's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Late 90's and early 2000s nostalgic visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth-based survival and exploration. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasite\u2019s can hear you, don\u2019t make a sound</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579980/extras/369921efc454460b0633580a53281c03.avif?t=1749218559\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of enemies and locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead survivors to safety</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready?</p>",
